Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.44,Default,,200,200,45,,If you fold a regular sheet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.44,0:00:02.70,Default,,200,200,45,,of paper in half to reach
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:06.90,Default,,200,200,45,,the Moon , 384,400 kilometers away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:08.05,Default,,200,200,45,,, how many folds would it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.05,0:00:10.39,Default,,200,200,45,,take Most people guess thousands or
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.39,0:00:12.09,Default,,200,200,45,,even millions . But the real
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.09,0:00:14.43,Default,,200,200,45,,answer is shockingly small Every
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.43,0:00:15.60,Default,,200,200,45,,time you fold a paper ,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:17.78,Default,,200,200,45,,its thickness doubles . One fold
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:19.78,Default,,200,200,45,,gives two layers . Two folds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.78,0:00:21.58,Default,,200,200,45,,give four . Three folds give
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:24.28,Default,,200,200,45,,eight A logarithm base two simply
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:26.12,Default,,200,200,45,,flips the question : it counts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:27.57,Default,,200,200,45,,how many doublings it takes to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.57,0:00:29.54,Default,,200,200,45,,reach your target Log base two
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:30.94,Default,,200,200,45,,of eight is three , because
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.94,0:00:33.09,Default,,200,200,45,,three doublings make eight Now look
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.09,0:00:34.70,Default,,200,200,45,,at the Moon . The average
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:39.01,Default,,200,200,45,,distance is 384,400 kilometers .
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.01,0:00:40.12,Default,,200,200,45,,Compared to a tenth of a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.12,0:00:42.12,Default,,200,200,45,,millimeter of paper , that's about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:45.27,Default,,200,200,45,,3.8 trillion layers Ten folds is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.27,0:00:47.11,Default,,200,200,45,,about a thousand layers , ten
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.11,0:00:49.40,Default,,200,200,45,,centimeters high Twenty folds is a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.38,Default,,200,200,45,,million . Thirty folds is a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.38,0:00:53.39,Default,,200,200,45,,billion , over a hundred kilometers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.39,0:00:55.22,Default,,200,200,45,,up Forty folds is over a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.22,0:00:58.05,Default,,200,200,45,,trillion , 110,000 kilometers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.34,0:01:01.12,Default,,200,200,45,,Forty-one is 220,000 kilometers ,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.12,0:01:03.54,Default,,200,200,45,,still short And forty-two folds ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:06.67,Default,,200,200,45,,440,000 kilometers . Past the Moon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.07,0:01:09.13,Default,,200,200,45,,Just forty-two folds . That is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.13,0:01:11.16,Default,,200,200,45,,what a logarithm actually is :
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.16,0:01:12.50,Default,,200,200,45,,counting the hidden steps of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.50,0:01:13.57,Default,,200,200,45,,explosive growth
